target_text:
// 12. Check that the results for kv head 0 are the same up to a floating-point
// tolerance. The two runs reach a token's page with a different running
// maximum m. So each softmax weight exp(s - m) is truncated to bf16 for the
// PV product (Note [AMX attention dispatch]) at a different scale. One
// truncation step is up to 2^-7 of the weight. With a 32-token window that
// moves one element of the weighted V sum by up to about 0.02 (measured
// 0.018 with row-major K and 0.022 with VNNI K, whose scores differ in the
// last bits). s_star adds the fp32 weights and differs by a few ulp only.
// The VNNI bound on it is relative: a few ulp at any magnitude.

body:
**[comments] Rule 4, comment lines that map to no code line: shorten**

Two parts map to nothing in this function: "rounded to nearest even on the AMX path" (this test has kv_mul 2, so amx_attn_h128g4::shape_ok is false and no AMX path runs) and the last three sentences, which read the numbers back from the code (`layout_on ? 5e-2 : 2e-2`, WithinAbs 2e-6f, WithinRel 1e-6f). The derivation of 0.02, the two measurements and the reason for a relative s_star bound stay.

Proposed:
```cpp
  // 12. Check that the results for kv head 0 are the same up to a floating-point
  // tolerance. The two runs reach a token's page with a different running
  // maximum m. So each softmax weight exp(s - m) is truncated to bf16 for the
  // PV product (Note [AMX attention dispatch]) at a different scale. One
  // truncation step is up to 2^-7 of the weight. With a 32-token window that
  // moves one element of the weighted V sum by up to about 0.02 (measured
  // 0.018 with row-major K and 0.022 with VNNI K, whose scores differ in the
  // last bits). s_star adds the fp32 weights and differs by a few ulp only.
  // The VNNI bound on it is relative: a few ulp at any magnitude.
```

Line-to-code mapping (Rule 4):
L1-2 (kv head 0 equal up to a tolerance) -> check_kv_head_0_against_saved (2733); L2-3 (two runs, different running maximum m) -> the step 7 vs step 11 apply_page_range runs, the reason a tolerance exists; L3-4 (weight truncated to bf16 at a different scale) -> v_star_tolerance (2732); L4-5 (one truncation step 2^-7) -> the 2e-2 derivation; L5-8 (32-token window, measured 0.018 / 0.022) -> `? 5e-2 : 2e-2` (2732); L8 (s_star few ulp) -> WithinAbs 2e-6f (2741); L9 (relative VNNI bound) -> WithinRel 1e-6f (2738).
